                <div class="eyebrow">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size:16px;">storage</span>
                    <span>Own your data</span>
                </div>
                <h2>Run GoatLab on your own hardware.</h2>
                <p>
                    Prefer to keep your farm data off the cloud? GoatLab ships as a single Docker container.
                    Deploy it on a Raspberry Pi in the barn, a NAS in the office, or a VPS — whatever you
                    already have. Pull the prebuilt image from Docker Hub or clone the repo and build it
                    yourself — either way, one <code>docker compose up</code> and the whole app is running
                    locally with its own SQL Server database and media volume.
                </p>
                <ul class="self-host-list">
                    <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span> Same app you see here — no feature lock-out</li>
                    <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span> Data stays on your network, in your volumes</li>
                    <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span> Runs on Linux, QNAP, Synology, and Windows</li>
                    <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span> Free and open — source on GitHub</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="self-host-ctas">
                    <a href="@RepoUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-filled btn-lg">
                        <svg class="gh-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
                        View on GitHub
                    </a>
                    <a href="@($"{RepoUrl}#self-hosting")" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outlined btn-lg" style="color:#a5d6a7;border-color:#66bb6a;">
